==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Relay Base (Enemy Base)|Relay Base]].
*3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Large Red Ball]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*4 [[Red Wind]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Large Red Ball]]s spawn after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Take into heart what you learned in [[Rank-Up Test 1 (Rank 5)]] and use meatshielding, [[Whale Cat]] and [[Dragon Cat]] to blow up Shy Boy.

